{"id":"n91093-2-7","stage":2,"title":"맘 · 心","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91093-2-7-1","ko":"할아버지, 인터넷을 저보다 더 잘 하시네요?","zh":"爷爷，您上网的本事比我还要强啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지,","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인터넷을","meaning":"互联网","explanation":"인터넷：互联网；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70774","senseId":"1","lemma":"인터넷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저보다","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하시네요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"020698f8f7c78429","term":"인터넷","zh":"互联网","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3","entryId":"70774","definition":"连接全世界的电脑使其可以互相交换信息的巨大电脑通信网。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/642b8398d0d1a0d8ca1c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91093-2-7-2","ko":"내가 몸은 늙었어도 맘은 누구보다 청춘이야.","zh":"虽然我的身体老了，但我的心却比任何人都年轻。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몸은","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늙었어도","meaning":"老，衰老","explanation":"늙다：老，衰老；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"늙다","audio":"/audio/45918e04c62b7a6d9c2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63500","senseId":"1","lemma":"늙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맘은","meaning":"心","explanation":"맘：心；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"맘","audio":"/audio/9f71c521ad5eede5a6fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91093","senseId":"2","lemma":"맘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구보다","meaning":"谁都，无论是谁","explanation":"누구：谁都，无论是谁；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"2","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"청춘이야.","meaning":"青春","explanation":"청춘：青春；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"청춘","audio":"/audio/c060678376c1c4bcdf09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25347","senseId":"1","lemma":"청춘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"45918e04c62b7a6d","term":"늙다","zh":"老，衰老","audio":"/audio/45918e04c62b7a6d9c2a.mp3","entryId":"63500","definition":"上了年纪。","pronunciation":["늑따"]},{"id":"9f71c521ad5eede5","term":"맘","zh":"心","audio":"/audio/9f71c521ad5eede5a6fd.mp3","entryId":"91093","definition":"在人体内进行感觉或思考等精神活动的地方。","pronunciation":["맘ː"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁都，无论是谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指尚未确定的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"c060678376c1c4bc","term":"청춘","zh":"青春","audio":"/audio/c060678376c1c4bcdf09.mp3","entryId":"25347","definition":"年轻、年少的岁月。","pronunciation":["청춘"]}],"audio":"/audio/ddf1a3a5ce0d0b05c9fb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.485,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91093","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.3117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["虽然我的身体老了，但我的心却比任何人都年轻。","这么多书要怎么带回家呢？","爷爷，您上网的本事比我还要强啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["虽然我的身体老了，但我的心却比任何人都年轻。","爷爷，您上网的本事比我还要强啊？","这么多书要怎么带回家呢？"],"answer":0}]}
